        "en": "Comfort of familiar home surroundings"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many reviewers highlight the immense value of having veterinary care provided directly at home. Families appreciate avoiding the emotional stress of clinical waiting rooms, allowing pets to spend their final moments surrounded by family in comfortable and familiar home settings."
      }
